<title>FRANCE: New EU wheat export campaign depends on weather.</title>
<headline>New EU wheat export campaign depends on weather.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission, which closed its weekly export tender for 1996/97 soft wheat on Thursday, has yet to decide when to open bidding for the next campaign, European grain officials said.</p>
<p>The timing of a new export tender for 1997/98 (July/June) depends on the weather, they said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not fixed a date. To know when we are going to do that, you have to know what the weather is going to do,&quot; an official familiar with EU export policy said.</p>
<p>Persistent dry weather in parts of Europe including France has raised industry fears of damage to wheat yields.</p>
</text>
